# Displaying <%= BasketContent.model_name.human %> to Members

<%= BasketContent.model_name.human %> can now be displayed to your members directly on their deliveries page. When enabled, they will see a product list for their next delivery, based on their <%= BasketSize.model_name.human.downcase %> and depot.

This can be activated and customized from [the <%= BasketContent.model_name.human.downcase %> settings](/settings#basket_content):

- **Visibility window**: Control when the content becomes visible by setting the number of hours before the delivery day.
- **Title and note**: Customize the heading and add an optional note (e.g. to mention that contents are subject to change).
- **Display quantity**: Optionally show the quantity next to each product name.

As a reminder, <%= BasketContent.model_name.human(count: 2).downcase %> can also be included in your newsletters using Liquid templates. For more details, see the new [<%= BasketContent.model_name.human %>](/handbook/basket_content) handbook page.
